{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1375,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:834637c80eeaab6e5861875d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～！果然这套最让我心安呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef1038cee11f2f5ccb986f45c7b9216509a21806c276f56f13553dedd543e48d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8941c6ab3e79b4a4be8ecb2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，有点小饿……\r\n去趟古早味零食店吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "f66b910e1d66a81dee0fc52d91dff40ce9b28b2ffafbe897557aee7c032d8ccc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e68a2bc61b5c1c8d218b90d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ひゃ～、カワイイ振袖～！\r\n…これ、アタシので合ってます？",
      "source_fingerprint": "45ce75dfba2d507334b55a9b4e189e8b0951051d3475c51a2542e629db5d3ca2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "70216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21610f40b25e12c4032e28ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ちょ、見過ぎでは！？\r\n服はね？この服は素敵ですけど！",
      "source_fingerprint": "84f1d9f8c0dfb57b429a38e4dff534484fce733616ed97ee6dfd0effa512b379",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "70217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3d84611746715428ee42ab0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊哈哈…至少要把褶边弄好吧～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "999f29447d5df94f8afb09c85695a48ee5252688890c657917e05183c6bc0a8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5136a03462b5e19aa39e13c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好羞…这样的，不合适啊…",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7d83e0c7ff6b3117852eb952805b28b0f76fa9d92d30cc10a81ff5a61ebd0e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcad5e0a738948471bf721a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇啊…不行不行。要打起精神才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55061b7ec3a3d9cae0a94cfb632cd456de52c6932d73cb3cf2f1756378fe1caf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:802838e6279ec4ee4f1445dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这双长靴…选得还挺大胆的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "47b0ae0f8171683abb6fcfcea8a46986529f6858b59e83fb6e980a47f0680a31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7afd5b6b8a4d65f212783591",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜哇～…太可爱了！痒痒的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c879b9361b7ab441a2e4b6592f387aa09e09fbb7fdd7e6ff7868cc4996b89487",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a8c588dcc9fd97c2ad7981a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎，怎样？不会看不下去…就行了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "499e30a2bc7a591f20aa65b11529d1ee5918b20bd970c82d14a116247388dc92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:facccd3bf24c9a1090fe89c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管怎么说，周围的人都在给我加油。\r\n我也干脆再加把劲吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9942dbd3940cefa9e7873058278f026e160bfb086bc145ff26a25d497f2b96b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d15a62632e7b9d1c43b6e276",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "GOーGOー！训练员！\r\n…还是把刚才的忘掉吧，忘掉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d1fbeadc357ce8564079a1dbd1de0da9ed5e1efce41902aba347b37dacd0902",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab800731c65dffbd08df1e6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闪着光呢ー……",
      "source_fingerprint": "db16ba35c573b7d4ca99e09689fc39a3b4b0d2bb5a5fdac67d954e4b29340413",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79e85f604f82f99bc900f5ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是我，偶尔也能……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "811f4f976efd89a2d1d8c9b063f583a2e4dcae03f64e22310ee56ad6a404e352",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31a4cb6ed2bab68bfb0f01ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ひゃ～、カワイイ振袖～！\r\n…これ、アタシので合ってます？",
      "source_fingerprint": "45ce75dfba2d507334b55a9b4e189e8b0951051d3475c51a2542e629db5d3ca2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "71216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:013077f00dd7c9aca11b044b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ちょ、見過ぎでは！？\r\n服はね？この服は素敵ですけど！",
      "source_fingerprint": "84f1d9f8c0dfb57b429a38e4dff534484fce733616ed97ee6dfd0effa512b379",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "71217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f2bec3a4007f9cdc46191dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おつかれさーん",
      "source_fingerprint": "bafb563f0fe9041ba486b13f2f00e07c3b093dbbd4e2b015020a7ea67941f61e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afc9f48fdb21c0533c21e6af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我偶尔也是能做到的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c03622d978d84a4701dcfe7ea5b4212cddcd161128d59e7e43d14924dc9f9e35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "800000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d393a75fb237ba6ad5950d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请手下留情啊ー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "592f906a18569ed7e792a696f32063d16e082a76225a88d7c028afd3fe4af0fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81656b6bb084e71d33633d76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次才打算放弃，\n会太坏了吗？\n不，但是…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f1fcd269715fe867cfaf2b361c3ca5472f4212b8a82017216249d951ccc7406",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:141dda1d4d1bf44962678f88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早ー。首先是早上的伸展运动～。\n肩膀放松一下吧～…嘿。\n就这样轻松的做吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "20a631f29fa005d650c5c504d88b39ef73860e2b1a3bfab9ccd1b5358d0fe94e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e7a93580a0289b81da47303",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哟ー，训…啊啦啦。还困吗？\n那么，早上要一起散步吗？\n好像对健康长寿有帮助哦～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ba86adf00c4689d176eafbed96f7c0eb5519e6fd7149d024f092c653877fecd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3305d9a77bd2b4e887401f4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午休的时候，不知悔改地去便利店\n抽彩票…获得3等奖的次数更新！\n…那个只有3等奖吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b89d3d21efc23f9f5b5dd751acc168fbba9125c5320617c2857daf73c9d2b22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27f77b19bb01b01b66f8b020",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "路过校舍后面的时候，看到\n青云天空和猫一起在睡午觉。我不由得\n烦恼该摸哪个头好。呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fc95187e016339a3ed9eb6051e773fe5896327440129395113d75b1fbba2fd6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0134013c085e0baa02008185",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦，训练员现在才吃晚饭？\n还是说…和我一样是来吃夜宵的？\n咱们一起吃吧～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac4125be6509d6f53fd8826c8ac8f530dcd667fd88d56e385babc2403c867aab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a4a4542c6899bac6477f06f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀。这么晚辛苦了。\n嗯ー…工作结束后要喝东西吗？\n我请客哦～虽然是果汁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a92bca39ea59e6d5e8bc7dca39d88f2f498a01c9680a4d98f17227b1375ffb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c49de8e21a719c78bb8cf013",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天是宴会的季节吧。\n呵呵，好怀念啊。…以前偶尔\n会在老家做做饭。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24dcf6c6a336b74886b99b833ad7c6fbef90c3322f81e1c6a1b8d5f6ffd2f3b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:076267a60c646e1a5b627566",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿嚏～…变得\n什么都不想做了…\n哈啊～…好想在空调房里终老啊ー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05d767bfece6751bbc770fe9e9a29ee1db0c10654b6993056b593c9a39120459",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:744d729eb2efabc63e3fbf7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "旅游季节，来啦！\n等了很久了～♪\n登山用的鞋子，保养一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd34af9b95c8e51919495be90d3ed6d2ecea3c2da4b8ba9fa2ea57f209ff0aa0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74b404e07fe5973e1db35c43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊ー好冷好冷！好想吃\n热乎乎的东西啊…啊，对啦\n一起去吗？我知道一个好摊子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7017658616b39b4eb4f8968e8d83381c2674b3eeccd7cb1192108a2e256af31f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdb3866c370f0d38bb06d8a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好，还有点困呢～。\r\n今天一整天也要，加油加油。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a41806e690aa353779b777614de32fb03e1bad5674b61ab7510eb7ac3e067e9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3eb89e5930459ca8ee26cda7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员呀，要不要\r\n玉子烧呢？…哎呀～，\r\n做便当一不小心做多了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "145138968889384eddee1fa89353834f380a2f42a92c8e99e1c7462c31a3de76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6374a68cd08375a209b72e8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吃饱了就会犯困呢ー。\r\n给你发个能提神的东西吧？\r\n猫咪怪笑的照片。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c71a1bfeff5a9cdcf7195c37975846922dc23dd82400d76abae1a3db9178977d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7449d7b98a0b5168e2e7eb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一直努力到中午的大家，\r\n真了不起。\r\n下午也继续努力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41cd2ccbaaa9c75dcb3bc0827b33906f5d1421ae2e86480977043789df292f03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:698bc03c58466a179877aa3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要吃夜宵吗？\r\n虽然在冰箱里冻过了，\r\n但感觉还能吃呢～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f0b0a053ac7787b9b847abc6c02661212c43c3b6d6a6827371be9439003161a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a942c18e8f122071fc672b32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下课后来一杯，真带劲啊～。\r\n训练员要不要？\r\n梅昆布茶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0f36af4496cd7709bedc913dcfbd1030547d8ab917fc78e9b050f716a77341d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57ab9bd17612220d05e9faca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天到了啊。训练员也想\r\n挑战一下新事物吗？\r\n那样的话，我给你加油哦～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d4d511149587261544dc776236cf0fe3fbf5f957d90113ce1dff4400e0b0d97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e521d817331c1da552d4a75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你那表情，看来是顶不住\r\n夏天的炎热了啊。\r\n喂喂，可别输了啊ー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f867988e2676be35b523a58ce099715173a6b68d96495b121821d36a33f62ed7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a93d28d09e665edfb43b4e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "果然啊，还是更习惯\r\n秋天这种能静下心来的季节呢。\r\n啊哈哈，感慨过头了嘛？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a14b8e73f9526fc9ca876404b86ddbf00d8a774315984e1447af722a89c0f46d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:575615245cb49854ab125a24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "萝卜干配上炸豆腐…\r\n寒冷的季节就会想念\r\n温暖的小吃呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b32b4295b6ba6812526ba6f0185de821fba0e7c7b334b211ecf02f3f4869ff0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01ab77c481c85d7e556f82fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b5b28b99d88bf79f962e322",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:917c5cb4d562d4590bbcfabd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今朝ランニングしてたら、商店街の\r\nおっちゃんも走っててさ…アタシに\r\n勝とうとすんだよ？元気だよね～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b9fa855add5cb077beeb33a9b6c57ab49c1280d43a9809667937c9a5db7debe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b346e87a40ee7097f1835d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝から着付けをすると、気が\r\n引き締まりますな～。まあ、中身は\r\nいつものネイチャさんですけど。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f97fc4d1f292bc8712d44c02e20fb4203328a64de6b63122eae16fb43cd0e4f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0f40bced62cc4cee77a7651",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お昼、一緒にお蕎麦でもどうです？\r\n実はいい店見つけちゃってさ～。\r\nにんじんの天ぷら、絶品ですよ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb89bc4dc02287749e22a9d6b167a4b2cf9e20a06948278b72c20d0697b25614",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e96fb0a4cc06b55f05a275a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふわぁ～…とと、昼寝はまずいか。\r\nこんなド高そうな振袖に、\r\nシワなんかつけられませんって…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "68fe6e7cbeffec8be7abc3a0ae297eeb19c745f14f63c1d5dd904c1c8340b4c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d62fdb3239b997548c6f5978",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ん、お疲れですな？…仕事の反省は\r\nいったんやめてさ。お風呂入って、\r\n牛乳でもクイッといきましょ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fc1193519df57083c472115e4a2eee7a2c809dfca93a3fdb3b05fd9647a4576",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad5975cc820889ce901d261f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナーさん、夕飯に焼き餅でも\r\nどうです？商店街のみんなが山ほど\r\nくれたのが、まだ余っててさ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e4e027cad39ddfc044579b0754d7ea45675fa684b359f8e554c288a23f2a36f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b04aab92d855922b99b5fc0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あ～…そいやさ、商店街のみんなが\r\nお花見誘ってくれたんだけど。\r\n…予定、聞いてもいい？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9d5ad00956f5210682f8ec089be2ad182770194811300ebbf7244d6761e1fb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2203a01054c6e805274ff59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "や～夏はしょっぱいものに\r\n限りますなぁ。砂肝をつまみに、\r\nコーラでキュッといきますか～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac7c580a21f2efe343d444c2c4b30e15f60bd5897f7712c758cf91c58d4dfe83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:350fc7ced2a93c4210e9b9d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紅葉にも映える格好でしょ？\r\n…って、自分で言ってて恥ずかし！\r\n…顔が紅葉みたい？も、もぉぉ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a03ceb626f40c16a976ffab8feda76216b04ef246dc896abd39739726b0e94f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2eeef25287dbace39ff01efd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "着物にコタツ、そして丸くなってる\r\nお猫さん！いや～、冬にはやっぱり\r\n猫は欠かせませんにゃ～…なぁ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3dd1d39ae89a5175dc8412bd58151ad734ac58fa551f8842bfb06078b6e7e4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96cf35b2402c769f419b2b0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッピーバレンタイン",
      "source_fingerprint": "205aa64f55aa5b5868c584cadc0b5dcd8e05b84b0a76c8efb1da86986277c562",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77da3c884270173a070eb8e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帝王，今天也在闪闪发光啊\n…真是精神饱满啊。\n各种意义上的比不过啊～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91a2569fc0ec3372eb2d31b8b52fc3f478acaffa69b8b3134553acda08cd01a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:862247d31479d89faa4e38cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看邮购节目时不知不觉就\n买东西了…前几天也是，\n买了些蝮蛇的粉末…",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9485eb26afb960ef62353cae09ffa9c5047b73c4d1992366521a315b2608052",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74e965d5da5a9da861bf84e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "房间里有个好闹钟。\n喊着『美妙！』\n就这么起床了的马娘。哈哈…哈啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdb9c83e942156ce5c24b570671e7f9872ffab8b10c68e16c32ac259b5c22254",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79c74adda47eee81dffcfd12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀ー。从刚才开始总觉得\n～有猫的声音…才发现手机，\n还开着猫的视频。真好笑啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad893d1447954f81d38559047e1b07de42d1133a73ac6d193b9bc52830ca3a13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83a3ecacf7a108fe245242a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有活泼女孩的地方，\n总感觉会很精神呢。\n…哈，去摸猫猫来充电吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0015a9ca91ab2f6d516abc103292aa47fdd6195b28bed3f6a2c9aa40c2a56e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:553c17d1b48505e19e2e120d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "额！这不是把肚脐都露出来了吗！\n真的需要吗，这个。\n…演唱会前偷偷延长吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0c08636478677d4bc9786d955dd6974b307abbd27a2763d08cbaf858defe9b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8462846e9c0699988c2eaf8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇哈ー。轻飘飘的呢～。\n然后洋溢出来的，穿着的感觉。\n啊ー…差，差不多该脱了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0b09042b198df322bf7639569ce759363ba79a85328eb6d17672148b51e08ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a7a73d5787d415cc1c41176",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…嗯嗯～，可恶。嘴角要翘起来了。\n我的决胜服，做的…\n可真好啊…太好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee17e004c3e7f54af5a5e58cc593aeb12251a3b77432a0ae911d697aa3caba9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:678e5cbe5865cf3160904839",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着这个赢了的话很帅呢…\n怎么说呢！啊哈哈哈。\n…嘛，我会尽力的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a465e3e43178ee1bef94b1d2e8fab9e02da039a24f1db26209730514d1bd2a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27c95573eeb61b0ec8415a84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上的时候总想\n『噗咻！』地出去呢～。…你那是什么表情？\n不，是说罐装咖啡啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e8f7e6a14585fa340b6c142589e037a4a82429c91eee3a24d95162fdec59888",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01d0f2445552b7b41c6ea70f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "轻轻地跑吧～。…毕竟，\n不是训练，也没有饿肚子。\n又不是那种热血的角色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4865a8063c81867198eb7eb691f93c134852b1fc70a8ee75f7965f0a90e7ec49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e920c17c541d2bc5be7bb70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "重炮明明说要熬夜，但一跟她说\n成熟的女人要早睡才能保持美丽\n她就马上就去睡觉了！…真好搞定。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45cd4dd99edea9d8f1c6b6cd0a37a3d7c2db4800f2c7f077af22812bf3b516f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01e847fc3f4bb1b3238e40f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着轻飘飘，很有春天气息的孩子，\n又增加了呢～。眼福眼福♪\n果然还是要穿亮闪闪的衣服才行啊～",
      "source_fingerprint": "29ce5031ec0e8591cc16f32af3900a6b8b4e7ec7ea57ba83b88715253cd182dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f219de27bf3ae6973f30d58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我喜欢桑拿，\n但是这个热天和那个不一样啊～…\n饶了我吧～…",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1e2aa171265dbc460faa9d39a3a78e3b822c15cee34978411234c7de126c324",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80422ab459d418cb0b64c425",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昨天，秋刀鱼的骨头飞快地\n就挑完了。哎呀，这种朴素地喜悦\n…这也是秋天的乐趣啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2e30ba4bf71895abdac77ce844c094fd3d8f941f11a3915dc5a4ec0af08d964",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b444f4b925ca7810dae97ea5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在这么冷的时候去泡露天温泉的话，\n真是太棒了…\n啊啊～，好想去温泉啊～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76f3b49509c3481c0dcd832d086b6f84df63097ed65cc879fe8e0a3880d91f9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0904bac1e04bb3cfb3c35e13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然会感到被期待的压力。\r\n但从实际上来讲\r\n还是很感谢大家的支持的…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c67c970dddcab05576801b0962a12138d9e2e241a29a57ca3bae4f72c5151dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51a12ac8c001380be2c3e0c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "光环很认真，\r\n只要有做的不好的地方ー。\r\n就会不自觉地多管闲事呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "014c8b0662f38fa89dc7447c65af4b84040149e0130b67345cbf48dd86b38f90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e9671d74dc26462ef5696bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "采珠同学能认真地关注着大家，\r\n好厉害啊。虽然她也有奇宝子怪怪的地方…\r\n不过总有人生前辈的感觉呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d7de5d7a2360d5eb71bdd37e533595560085d3666d5370128700d772aeaa7d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ab7d3bcaff86dc782c64c8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我家那个小弟弟也说\r\n要给我加油。\r\n…这下姐姐必须得努力才行啊ー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2aa05e0d536d86fd44d08b3568f781360884552d66635530302ab78c1d3d19a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2d5f4a4bf5eb76ee79f802a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，我的发型有没有变得很怪？\r\n刚才被喊着『蓬蓬发型才Marvelous☆』\r\n然后头发被乱抓了一通…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd561efb3f98cae5c4634b33e5559ae7cd6ce40e791078ebb5248f20d956862d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:145f2a3ae191cb88d76b2d96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "摩耶和涡轮从早上开始\r\n就在开心地跑圈～。\r\n光看着她们就能打起精神来呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c7087c1400050ed309abd0942dc7050c9569bc5d0d9a1e59fa8d9ca1f2cd6bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0868b1cf0d7f06090edbec35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "内恰姐来给你加个油，\r\n帮你熬过下午吧？\r\n呜…别用那么期待的眼神看着我啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "476edbd8aa0c3beee93a764f9c50b8d4c8c27f1c35a9b02d7b098e42d4ce5cde",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:400e01dc23e879283f88af0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。鳐鱼翅配可乐，\r\n来一杯吗？无论是发牢骚还是其他琐事，\r\n内恰姐都会听哦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f763e755d04b9b740f20f8b430b19d44013273f59c8b6b2088f12ee7f8fe2e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ae77a9308a15bebfceb6b70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "带着新生参观学校的时候…\r\n她们那闪闪发光的眼神，\r\n对我来说太刺眼了～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "955b3f2f8d3a1803fbdc46f7fd4259d3b28916fa24c304c02216e92b2d0f6581",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5240a97487035ba6803c615",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "提到夏天就少不了热血青春！\r\n年轻人们要加油啊ー！\r\n…我就呆在家里吃点素面啥的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f2e05140354f64606b337690618976ad897d2f975289928815327cc5e64e050",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8439d6dd3652d317854eaf64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "商店街里要办秋季庆典啊。\r\n毕竟他们一直在给我加油，\r\n我也去帮帮忙吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af20cec550fa8b41dd9de211b12abcd0257a1e20da49907975e8eaa4e9020ae5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91026"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
